# UI system: one ink on paper

`docs/ui/` is the source of truth. This rule summarises it; when they disagree, `docs/ui/` wins.

The whole site is one cobalt ink printed on cream paper, with riso grain, Literata italic headings, radius 0, hairline rules, duotone plates, a Hollar engraving band in the colophon (its only appearance) and an "In this issue" column beside the home hero. The site opens in Paper (light); dark mode ("Night print") is the same sheet reversed: cream ink on night paper, and the menu sheet offers Paper, Night and System. Hierarchy comes from size, italic against roman, and rules.

The old monochrome / grayscale language, Instrument Serif, Bricolage Grotesque, Inter, JetBrains Mono, `MacWindow` panels and glass surfaces are retired. Never reintroduce them.

## Tokens

Defined in `src/app/globals.css` (HSL triples, `:root` and `.dark`) and exposed in `tailwind.config.ts`.

| Class | Paper | Night | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| `paper` | #F3ECDC | #0D1433 | Page, card, text on solid ink |
| `ink` | #1E3C9E | #EFE6D2 | Text, icons, strong rules, solid button, focus, charts, engraving |
| `ink-soft` | #445BAA | #A9B5E3 | Secondary text (paper or tint only) |
| `rule` | #BFC6DE | #2C3870 | Decorative hairlines |
| `rule-strong` | #6476B2 | #7383C4 | Control boundaries |
| `tint` | #E2E4EB | #162868 | Hover row, code ground, inset |

- shadcn names map onto these (`background`/`card`/`popover` = paper, `foreground`/`primary`/`ring`/`destructive` = ink, `muted`/`secondary`/`accent` = tint, `muted-foreground` = ink-soft, `border` = rule, `input` = rule-strong).
- **Never**: palette colours (`blue-500`, `neutral-*`, `zinc-*`, ...), hex in class names, `white` / `black`, opacity on text (`text-foreground/70`), `dark:` variants. Tokens flip on `<html class="dark">`.
- Status, errors and destructive actions are shape plus word (8px square filled / outline / dashed, SVG cross, explicit verb). No red, green or amber.

## Type

- Literata only, roman and italic, via `next/font/google` (`--font-serif`, `--font-display`). `font-synthesis: none`.
- Italic: h1 to h4, display, one standfirst per page, captions, datelines, pull quotes, numerals.
- Roman: body, prose, nav, buttons (15/600), labels (13/600), table heads (12/600 ink-soft), tags (12), form values.
- Compact fluid scale (375 to 1280px), the `fontSize` keys in `tailwind.config.ts`: `body` 15 to 16px, `prose` 16 to 17, `lead` 17 to 19, `h3` 18 to 20, `h2` 22 to 30, `h1` 30 to 44, `display` 44 to 104, `numeral` 32 to 48, `small` 13, `caption` and `xs` 12. Use the keys, never ad-hoc sizes.
- System mono (`ui-monospace, ...`) only for code, slugs, keys, raw JSON, WPM passage, kbd. `font-mono` class only in code-block and kbd files.
- Sentence case. No `uppercase`, no `tracking-[...]`, no all-caps eyebrows, no middle-dot meta strings, no mono small labels, no "→" on links, numbered markers only for real sequences. Links underline 1px, 2px on hover. `tabular-nums` in ledgers, tables, figures.

## Three surfaces only

| Surface | Code | Use for |
|---|---|---|
| **Frame** | `Card`, `Surface variant="solid"` (`rounded-none border border-border bg-transparent`) | Content boxes, form slips, profile card |
| **Inset** | `Surface variant="inset"` (`bg-muted`) | Nested rows, code specimens, hover rows |
| **Lift** | `bg-paper border border-ink shadow-[3px_3px_0_hsl(var(--ink))]` | Floating layers only: Dialog, AlertDialog, Sheet, Popover, DropdownMenu, Tooltip, Select, Command, toasts, tracker drag |

- `glass` / `glass-static` are retired aliases of frame. Do not use them.
- Radius 0 everywhere; the radio dot is the only circle.
- No gradients, glass, `backdrop-blur`, glows, `shadow-sm`..`shadow-2xl`, hover lifts. Hover = rule turns ink or row takes `bg-tint`.
- Lines: hairline 1px rule; strong 1px ink; active 2px ink underline; page heads and the colophon sit on a single 1px ink rule; never stack rules; dotted leaders; dashed = draft or archived.

## Shell and page patterns

`BaseLayout` (`bleed?`, `footer?: 'full' | 'compact' | 'none'`) renders the sticky running head, the menu sheet, `main#main` and the colophon with the engraving band. No sidebars, no navbar, no scroll-to-top. Do not add horizontal padding inside it. Nav comes only from `src/commons/constants/navigation-menu.ts`.

| Pattern | Component | Routes |
|---|---|---|
| Ledger | `ui/ledger.tsx` | `/blog`, `/certificates`, `/changelog`, `/project` index, home Career and Certificates, admin lists |
| Article | `ui/article-shell.tsx` | `/blog/[slug]`, `/blog/onsite/[slug]`, `/project/[id]`, `/roadmap/[slug]`, `/legal/*` |
| Plates | `ui/plate-figure.tsx` | Covers, project shots, About portrait, OCR specimen, anime and Pokémon pictures |
| Cabinet | `tools/_components/tool-shell.tsx` + `ui/pager.tsx` | `/tools`, `/ai` |
| Correspondence | Letters column, replies behind a left rule | `/chat`, `/ai` chat, home Contact, admin Feedback |
| Board | Ruled columns of index cards | `/tracker` |
| Figures | `StatStrip`, `ui/ink-chart.tsx`, `ui/ink-heatmap.tsx`, `HatchBar` | `/stats`, home Readers, admin dashboard and analytics |
| Admin | Ruled spine, `--admin-rail` | `/admin/dashboard/*` |
| Auth | `layout/auth-shell.tsx` | `/auth/*`, `/admin/auth/login` |
| Profile card | Double-rule sheet, definition list | `/profile`, `/profile/edit`, admin settings |
| Not found | `ui/not-found-view.tsx` | 404s, `error.tsx`, empty states |

- One width for every page: fill BaseLayout's wrapper (`SHELL_WIDTH`), never narrow or centre the outer container; cap only running text with `max-w-[66ch]`. No page descriptions under the h1. Section rhythm via `PageSection` (`mt-12 sm:mt-16`). Titles via `SectionHeading` (no `marker`).
- Charts are server SVG (`InkChart`, `InkHeatmap`, `HatchBar`). Never add recharts.
- Fields are baseline only (`border-0 border-b border-input`). Buttons: `bg-ink text-paper`, never a `Button` inside a `Link` (use `asChild`).

## Brand, plates and details

- **Logo.** The RH monogram in one ink, only through `<Logo variant="mini" | "mark" | "tile">` (`ui/logo.tsx`): `mini` glyph in `currentColor` (running head, admin spine), `mark` adds four registration ticks at 60% ink (colophon, 404, auth, locked Etan AI view), `tile` reverses it out of an ink square. Never paste the SVG or recolour it. Art is generated by `node scripts/logo/make.mjs` (Node 22.18+); do not hand-edit `logo-art.ts`, `src/app/icon.svg`, `apple-icon.png`, `favicon.ico` or `public/brand/*`. `src/app/favicon.ico` must exist: the healthcheck fetches `/favicon.ico`.
- **Home hero.** Centred in the pinned stage: italic name (the LCP element), job line, the wordscroll sentence with a 24px floor on phones, and the links. From `lg` the "In this issue" column (`IssueIndex`: latest writing, latest project, most read, live) sits to the right behind one `rule` hairline; below `lg` the hero is text only. No photo or engraving in the hero; the Hollar band is colophon-only. About carries the duotone portrait (a lazy `PlateFigure`: 18rem left column from `md`, under the heading at up to 20rem on phones) and the prose with an italic drop cap.
- **PlateFigure.** `tone?: "photo" | "color"`. `photo` (default) is the duotone; `color` skips it (anime, Pokémon, OCR upload, site `/api/og` covers). The frame draws the focus outline when an interactive child is focused.
- **Generated cards.** `ogImageUrl(params, path?)` in `src/lib/site-url.ts` always sets `v=3`.
- **Hover tips.** `data-tip="..."` (`ui/hover-tip.tsx`), never the native `title`.
- **Contrast guard.** `src/__tests__/unit/lib/contrast.test.ts` fails below ink on paper 7:1, ink-soft on paper and tint 4.5:1, rule-strong on paper 3:1 and the wordscroll ghost 3:1, in Paper and Night.
- **Themes.** `defaultTheme="light"` with `enableSystem`; labels Paper, Night, System.

## Motion

- Tier 0 (no JS): native scroll, sticky layouts, `[id] { scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--head-h) + 1rem) }` (never `scroll-padding-top` on `html`: it scrolls the page whenever focus lands in the sticky head). `overflow-x: clip` on `html` and `main` only; never on `body`; never `overflow: hidden` / `auto` or `content-visibility` on a sticky ancestor.
- Tier 1 (CSS, `@supports (animation-timeline: view())` + no-preference): home wordscroll and the reading hairline (articles and home). Nothing else is scroll-linked.
- Response motion only: underline, `active:translate-y-px`, tab underline, accordion, dialog and sheet fade + 4px, toasts, tracker drag.
- **Banned:** parallax, marquees, typing effects, smooth cursor, page transitions, pulsing dots, pulse skeletons, fade-up / reveal on sections, `BlurFade`, Lenis, GSAP, `motion` / framer-motion. Nothing autoplays.
- Reduced motion: durations .01ms, wordscroll fully inked, sticky stays.

## Umami events

- `data-umami-event` only on `<button>` and external `target="_blank"` links. On an internal `<a>` the tracker calls `preventDefault` and reloads the page.
- Internal links: `data-track="nav-click" data-track-item="blog"`; the delegated listener in `deferred-client-utilities.tsx` forwards them. In code use `track()` from `src/lib/analytics.ts`.
- Kebab-case, 50 characters or fewer, enum values only, one event per element, never PII. Event table in `docs/ui/components.md`.

## Grep gate

Both must print nothing for the paths you touched (`$PHASE_PATHS`; final run `src content`). Never add a new hit; make touched files pass.

```bash
grep -rnIE "uppercase|tracking-[[]|(text|bg|border|from|to|via|ring|fill|stroke|divide|outline)-(green|red|yellow|orange|emerald|teal|violet|purple|blue|sky|indigo|amber|pink|rose|lime|cyan|neutral|zinc|slate|gray)-[0-9]{2,3}|shadow-(sm|md|lg|xl|2xl)|backdrop-blur|rounded-(sm|md|lg|xl|2xl|3xl|full)|dark:|BlurFade|from .motion|recharts" $PHASE_PATHS | grep -v "radio-group.tsx"
grep -rnIE "\bfont-mono\b|bg-gradient|gradient-to|(text|bg|border|fill|stroke|ring|from|to|via)-(white|black)\b|[\"' ]rounded[\"' ]|rounded-\[|rounded-(t|b|l|r|tl|tr|bl|br)-|#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}\b|text-(foreground|primary|muted-foreground)/[0-9]" $PHASE_PATHS content | grep -vE "code-block|kbd|api/(og|certificate)|lib/print-hex"
```

## Checklist before shipping UI

- [ ] Route uses one page pattern
- [ ] Ink / paper tokens only; no hex, palette colours, `white` / `black`, `dark:`
- [ ] Only frame, inset or lift
- [ ] Literata roles respected; mono only for machine text
- [ ] No banned motion; reduced motion works
- [ ] Umami attributes follow the button / external-link rule
- [ ] Accessible: `aria-current`, 44px targets under 768px, chart text alternatives, no horizontal scroll at 375px
- [ ] Grep gate prints nothing
